#. +> future stable
#: audioplayercontrolrunner_config.ui:36
msgid ""
"The collection search is only available for Amarok.\n"
"You may add another player. That player has to support the MPRIS specification."
msgstr ""
"De Sammelnsöök is bloots för Amarok verföögbor..\n"
"Du kannst man ok en anner Afspeler tofögen, de MPRIS-Markmalen ünnerstütt."

